{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026uQYcj6cUDp1793271299.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>黃大仙上邨因為有水管爆裂，要緊急暫停食水供應，預計凌晨3時恢復供水。</p><p></p><p>爆水管位置位於黃大仙道連接馬仔坑道一段，有食水浸出，水務署派人到場檢查，相關路段要封閉。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.BURST.WTS-1800_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026102m1TRpdM1793271305.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>水務署網頁資料顯示，因緊急維修水管工程，黃大仙上邨由下午3時起緊急停水，預計凌晨3時恢復供水，期間水務署會派水車到啟善樓及達善樓。</p><p></p><p>資料顯示，黃大仙上邨共有8座，有約4,800戶。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T11:21:48.566913+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":170,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T09:26:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T13:38:19.603681+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T11:18:22.153746+00:00","content_hash":"650c5fb497b8babaab2c3fce3daa39659a3b2e2ca99b7dd87068ccf55558171e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T11:21:48.566913+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}